* @title Immediate vs. conditional value assignment
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 2
* @expect >>>
* FIRST: B SECOND: EA THIRD: 
* BRVAL: READ
* <<<
         BR = (('B' | 'R') $ FIRST ('E' | 'EA') $ SECOND ('D' | 'DS') $ THIRD) . BRVAL
         'BEATS' BR                    :S(OK)
         OUTPUT = 'FIRST: ' FIRST ' SECOND: ' SECOND ' THIRD: ' THIRD
         'BREADS' BR                   :S(SHOW)
SHOW     OUTPUT = 'BRVAL: ' BRVAL
OK
END
